              "kind": "paragraph",
              "content": "Contact Payroll support at payroll.support@northwindfoods.example, Monday to Friday, 8am to 6pm — for portal activation, bank details, or anything about your pay dates.",
              "sources": ["brief:governance.help_route", "cb-help-and-support-routes-example"]
